    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "flow-detail",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 445,
      "width": 407.8125,
      "height": 285,
      "text": "① User → NPM (192.168.6.6)\n   • SSL termination with *.lab.danatlab.com wildcard cert\n   • Proxy to NodePort 30988\n\n② NPM → kgateway (Envoy L7)\n   • Host header match: litellm.lab.danatlab.com\n   • HTTPRoute selects LiteLLM backend\n\n③ kgateway → LiteLLM (litellm:4000)\n   • API key validation (<your-master-key>)\n   • Model routing: qwen2.5-14b → kubeai backend\n\n④ LiteLLM → KubeAI (kubeai:80/openai/v1)\n   • OpenAI-compatible proxy\n   • Routes to model pod by name\n\n⑤ KubeAI → Ollama Pod (Qwen 2.5 14B)\n   • GPU inference on RTX 3060 (9.4GB VRAM)\n   • Response streams back through chain",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 3033,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1136111533,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "① User → NPM (192.168.6.6)\n   • SSL termination with *.lab.danatlab.com wildcard cert\n   • Proxy to NodePort 30988\n\n② NPM → kgateway (Envoy L7)\n   • Host header match: litellm.lab.danatlab.com\n   • HTTPRoute selects LiteLLM backend\n\n③ kgateway → LiteLLM (litellm:4000)\n   • API key validation (<your-master-key>)\n   • Model routing: qwen2.5-14b → kubeai backend\n\n④ LiteLLM → KubeAI (kubeai:80/openai/v1)\n   • OpenAI-compatible proxy\n   • Routes to model pod by name\n\n⑤ KubeAI → Ollama Pod (Qwen 2.5 14B)\n   • GPU inference on RTX 3060 (9.4GB VRAM)\n   • Response streams back through chain",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aW",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1770667943583
